From 460772cfcff9f2e0ba54126548add7a2d5070680 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saalim Quadri <danascape@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:40:10 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] ANDROID: gki: enable RANDSTRUCT_FULL for aarch64

*** Do not apply. Depends on the previous patch, which does not work.

Randomizes 273 of the 11645 structures in the GKI BTF: 60 marked
__randomize_layout and 213 made only of function pointers.

RANDSTRUCT_FULL selects MODVERSIONS, so savedefconfig drops the explicit
CONFIG_MODVERSIONS=y. Turning RANDSTRUCT_FULL back off has to restore it or
the KMI loses symbol versioning silently.

arch/x86/configs/gki_defconfig is left alone, matching 6.1. The same series
built for x86_64 then has CONFIG_RUST=y and no randstruct.

Supply the seed as common/randstruct.seed, which is gitignored but still
reaches every kernel_build through //common:common_kernel_sources, or via
$KRANDSTRUCT_SEED. Record it with the release.

Rotate it per KMI_GENERATION bump, not per build, and regenerate
gki/aarch64/abi.stg via //common:kernel_abis_update: 6364 of the 9718 KMI
symbols change CRC, with no symbol added or removed.

Layouts are recoverable from the shipped image's .BTF section, so this
raises the cost of reusing an exploit written against stock GKI rather than
keeping layouts secret.

Signed-off-by: Saalim Quadri <danascape@gmail.com>
---
 .gitignore                       | 3 +++
 arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index daa789489eac..2d9318df0334 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -187,3 +187,6 @@ sphinx_*/
 
 # bc language scripts (not LLVM bitcode)
 !kernel/time/timeconst.bc
+
+# randstruct seed, supplied by the build infrastructure
+/randstruct.seed
diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
index 1d986d87725b..e3933b2693ac 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
@@ -110,7 +110,6 @@ CONFIG_ARCH_MMAP_RND_COMPAT_BITS=16
 CONFIG_RANDOMIZE_KSTACK_OFFSET_DEFAULT=y
 CONFIG_MODULES=y
 CONFIG_MODULE_UNLOAD=y
-CONFIG_MODVERSIONS=y
 CONFIG_GENDWARFKSYMS=y
 CONFIG_MODULE_SCMVERSION=y
 CONFIG_MODULE_SIG_FORCE=y
@@ -783,6 +782,7 @@ CONFIG_INIT_ON_FREE_DEFAULT_ON=y
 CONFIG_FORTIFY_SOURCE=y
 CONFIG_HARDENED_USERCOPY=y
 CONFIG_BUG_ON_DATA_CORRUPTION=y
+CONFIG_RANDSTRUCT_FULL=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_FIPS140_LIB_OVERRIDE_SUPPORT=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_NULL=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_ECDH=y
